stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> STARTED: Create Saga
    
    STARTED --> CREATE_ORDER: Execute Step 1
    CREATE_ORDER --> RESERVE_INVENTORY: Step 1 Success
    CREATE_ORDER --> FAILED: Step 1 Failed
    
    RESERVE_INVENTORY --> CONFIRM_ORDER: Step 2 Success
    RESERVE_INVENTORY --> COMPENSATING: Step 2 Failed
    
    CONFIRM_ORDER --> CONFIRM_INVENTORY: Step 3 Success
    CONFIRM_ORDER --> COMPENSATING: Step 3 Failed
    
    CONFIRM_INVENTORY --> COMPLETED: Step 4 Success
    CONFIRM_INVENTORY --> COMPENSATING: Step 4 Failed
    
    COMPENSATING --> COMPENSATED: All Compensations Success
    COMPENSATING --> COMPENSATION_FAILED: Compensation Failed
    
    COMPLETED --> [*]: Success
    COMPENSATED --> [*]: Rolled Back
    FAILED --> [*]: Failed Early
    COMPENSATION_FAILED --> [*]: Manual Intervention Needed
    
    state COMPENSATING {
        [*] --> CompensateStep4: If Step 4 executed
        [*] --> CompensateStep3: If Step 3 executed
        [*] --> CompensateStep2: If Step 2 executed
        [*] --> CompensateStep1: If Step 1 executed
        
        CompensateStep4 --> CompensateStep3: Inventory compensation done
        CompensateStep3 --> CompensateStep2: Order confirmation undone
        CompensateStep2 --> CompensateStep1: Inventory reservation cancelled
        CompensateStep1 --> [*]: Order cancelled
    }
    
    note right of COMPLETED
        All steps executed successfully
        Order is confirmed
        Inventory is allocated
    end note
    
    note right of COMPENSATED
        All executed steps compensated
        System returned to consistent state
        No side effects remain
    end note
    
    note right of COMPENSATION_FAILED
        Requires manual intervention
        Partial compensation state
        Alert operations team
    end note